- 素材：[CC BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/)

## **📌官方下載：**
* [Avaritia (1.1x)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-1-10)
* [Avaritia (官方)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia)
* [AvaritiaLite](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-lite)

## **❗注意事項：**
* 你 <span style="color: #00ff00;">**完全允許**</span> 將此模組加入你的模組包中。

## **🔎開發：**
### **CraftTweaker：**
```
mods.avaritia.CompressionCrafting.addRecipe("名稱",輸入, 輸入數量, 所需時間);
mods.avaritia.CompressionCrafting.remove(輸出);
mods.avaritia.ExtremeTableCrafting.addShaped("名稱",輸出, 材料);
mods.avaritia.ExtremeTableCrafting.addShapeless("名稱",輸出, 材料);
mods.avaritia.ExtremeTableCrafting.addCatalyst("名稱", 材料);
mods.avaritia.ExtremeTableCrafting.remove(輸出);
```

### **KubeJs：**
```js
ServerEvents.recipes(
    event => {
        //ExtremeCraft
        event.custom({
            type: 'avaritia:shaped_extreme_craft',//shapeless 為 avaritia:shapeless_extreme_craft
            pattern: [
                "       I ",
                "      III",
                "     III ",
                "    III  ",
                " C III   ",
                "  CII    ",
                "  NC     ",
                " N  C    ",
                "X        "
            ],
            key: {
                C: [
                    {item: 'avaritia:crystal_matrix_ingot'}
                ],
                I: [
                    {item: 'avaritia:infinity_ingot'}
                ],
                N: [
                    {item: 'avaritia:neutron_ingot'}
                ],
                X: [
                    {item: 'avaritia:infinity_catalyst'}
                ]
            },
            result: {item: 'avaritia:infinity_sword'}
        })
        //Compressor
        event.custom({
            type: 'avaritia:compressor',
            inputCount: 2000,
            timeCost: 240,
            ingredient: {tag: 'forge:ingots/copper'},
            result: { item: 'avaritia:singularity', count: 1 , nbt: {Id: 'avaritia:copper'}}
        })
        console.log('Hello! The avaritia recipe event has fired!')
    }
)
```
